#N canvas 100 100 760 600 12;
#X text 20 10 p8user: your own presets. Argument: the name of a [text define -k name] in your patch (its lines are saved with the patch \, or with "write file" / "read file" on it). A slot number 0... sends that slot as "dump pdoly8 ..." to the outlet (to pdoly8~ or its [s]) - nothing is written. "store N" stores the current sound in slot N: it asks pdoly8~ for a dump (outlet) and takes the answer at the right inlet (from outlet 2 of pdoly8~ \, e.g. via [s]/[r]). Only "store" ever writes., f 92;
#X obj 20 150 inlet;
#X obj 20 180 route store;
#X obj 20 210 t b f f f;
#X msg 20 520 dump;
#X obj 240 240 t f b;
#X obj 300 270 text size \$1;
#X obj 240 300 expr \$f1 + 1 - \$f2;
#X obj 240 330 moses 1;
#X obj 290 360 until;
#X msg 290 390 list -;
#X obj 290 420 text insert \$1 1e+07;
#X msg 120 250 1;
#X obj 520 150 inlet;
#X obj 520 180 route dump;
#X obj 520 210 spigot;
#X obj 520 240 t a b;
#X msg 610 270 0;
#X obj 520 300 list;
#X obj 520 470 text set \$1;
#X obj 140 180 moses 0;
#X obj 190 450 t f b;
#X obj 250 480 text size \$1;
#X obj 190 510 moses;
#X obj 190 540 text get \$1;
#X obj 400 540 route pdoly8;
#X obj 400 570 list prepend dump pdoly8;
#X obj 400 600 list trim;
#X obj 20 640 outlet;
#X obj 550 510 list trim;
